5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the past. What became of the last three internal rollouts?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the source. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am curious about the ground. Who is free to build? In-house developer availability.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the damage. Misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know who works. Staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, money is important, but history teaches us more about survival.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, history is nice, but if the pocket is empty, nothing happens.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, if the deliveries are wrong, the whole plan falls apart, right?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, exactly. The floor suffers when the data is wrong.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, if no one is available, the plan is just a dream.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,We should also see the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will stick to the budget. It is the only thing I can control.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will look at the network coverage at customer plants. It feels risky.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also look at the handling of vendor queries. It eats up hours.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what the past tells us before we spend the future.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I am quiet, but the numbers do not lie. I will check the allowance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the network is ready. I do not like surprises.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will count the seconds lost. That is where the truth is.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will count the people. That is where the pain is.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
