35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The file is open. The last three rollouts show a clear pattern of survival.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the pocket. The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found the ground. The developers are busy, and the network is weak.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I found the waste. Eleven misrouted deliveries, and an hour a day lost to copying.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I found the people. Two clerks do the work of five, and they are tired.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the allowance is good, but the pattern says narrow tools survive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, the licence pricing climbs with every head. The fixed-fee work is flat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, if the network drops, the copying gets worse, doesn't it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, yes. The copying is manual because the network is not trusted.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, if the developers are busy, who writes the new code?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The standardization efforts failed because they had no owner. We must pick one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried. The real bill often arrives with next year's renewal notice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I am worried. The customer plants are not our home. We cannot control them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am not worried. I am counting. The copying is the biggest leak.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I am not worried. I am counting. The clerks are the biggest risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,We have the facts. Let us look at the candidates with clear eyes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will look for the one that does not grow. The one that stays small.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I will look for the one that does not depend on the network.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look for the one that stops the copying. That is the real win.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will look for the one that does not add work to the clerks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
