60,3,1,talk,Servas,,Candidate A is a hub. Hubs need owners. We have no owner.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Candidate B is a tool. Tools need licences. Licences climb with every head.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Candidate D is an app. Apps need networks. The networks are weak.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Candidate A stops the copying. The copying is the biggest leak.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Candidate B adds work. The clerks are already tired.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, A stops the copying, but it is too wide. It will fail.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, B is narrow. It is a fixed-fee build. The cost is flat.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, B is narrow, but it needs the developers. The developers are busy.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, A is wide, but it is the only one that touches the floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, A is wide, but it is the only one that does not add work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,The pattern says narrow tools survive. B is narrow. A is wide.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The pocket says B is affordable. The capital is frozen, but the allowance has room.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,The ground says D is risky. The network is weak. The developers are busy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,The floor says A is the answer. The copying is the waste. The waste is the loss.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,The people say B is the risk. The clerks are the risk. The risk is the failure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,We must choose the one that survives. The one that is narrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I choose the one that does not grow. The one that stays small.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I choose the one that does not depend on the network. The one that is safe.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I choose the one that stops the copying. The one that is real.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I choose the one that does not add work. The one that is kind.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
